── SYNTAX ERROR ──────────────── E0100_rust_reference_parameter.lt:1:14  [E0100]

Stilt has no references: a parameter takes a value:

  1 │ fn len_of(s: &str) -> i64 { s.len() }
    │              ^

A parameter takes a value, which the function can't change. One written `inout`
changes the caller's variable, which the call marks `inout` too.

To fix it, take the value:

  1 │ fn len_of(s: &str) -> i64 { s.len() }
    │              -
